# Terraform
# WARNING: infra/ci-runner/terraform.tfstate is the ONLY record of the runner VM/network (local
# state, untracked on purpose: it holds sensitive values). `git clean -x` / `-fdx`, deleting the
# folder or re-cloning destroys it. Use `git clean -n` first. See README: "infra/ci-runner local state".
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Real environment inputs are committed; local scratch copies are not.
*.auto.tfvars.local
backend.hcl
terraform.tfvars

# Local contract builds
contract-out/
